meta {
  name: List tickets
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/tickets?status=open,in_progress&sort=priority&order=desc&page=1&pageSize=25
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  status: open,in_progress
  sort: priority
  order: desc
  page: 1
  pageSize: 25
  ~priority: high,critical
  ~assignee: me
  ~categoryId: 1
  ~search: RES-1001
}

docs {
  End users see only their own tickets; staff see the whole organization.
  Filters (all optional, combined with AND): status and priority (comma-separated),
  assignee (me | unassigned | user id), categoryId, search (title text or RES-1001).
  sort: created_at | updated_at | priority | resolution_due_at; order: asc | desc.
  Tick the disabled params to try them. Try page=2&pageSize=1 to see pagination.
}
